{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b690c62690bf2c691a8e72b6d27c67994aae6dc017bc7511db1b547678e32d00","ja":"ドッキリ大成功！？","zh":"整蛊大成功！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"029887d5274c2eaf4affe68f2eeebb982d698c774a8020a425d0526a801cef82","ja":"もう……桃子ちゃんの体から出ていけー！\nナムナムナム……怨霊たいさーん！","zh":"真是的……快从小桃子的身体里出去——！\n南无南无南无……怨灵退散——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"24c5e07f43638d3328fe2a1ccf3ca991786cea686674a6a10b2867571bc12b38","ja":"うっ、ぐぅぅぅぅっ！　そのような言葉で\nわたしを祓えると思っているのかぁぁぁ！","zh":"唔、咕呜呜呜呜！你以为凭这种话\n就能驱除我吗啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c9b707a45a112089914e1611904098b6ad22d2cd4e374ba3a28ef598ebfdf80d","ja":"きゃーっ！！　桃子ちゃん、元に戻って！\nねっ、お願いだからっ！","zh":"呀——！！桃子，快变回去啊！\n求求你了，求你变回来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5139eb93f56413d8eaf113a7a5d3960c1fea09fdc9ce491b0288413a750a253e","ja":"……ふふふっ、これくらいでいいよね♪\nじゃあ、みんないくよ。ドッキリ……。","zh":"……呵呵呵，这样就可以了吧♪\n那么，大家要上啰。整蛊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5f29c252528ff24ba93ad0625a607ee7ff63aad1028b62d67040429468cee070","ja":"大・成・功ーーーっ！！！","zh":"大·成·功——！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e694be5ca9ff00191398f60d8afa554ed3037fff8d4bd8ab4b0a02f774ebb088","ja":"えっ……ええ～っ！\nど、どういうこと～っ！？","zh":"诶……诶诶～！\n这、这是怎么回事～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b7987596c5376cc8ed4368bb71841d4f91149d5f7d4812adce8d8f0e5065d59f","ja":"面妖な……どっきりをしていたのは私達のはず。\nなのにどうして、このみが「大成功」と……？","zh":"委实古怪……策划整蛊的明明应该是我们才对。\n可为什么，科诺美却喊着“大成功”……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"8bdf03480f29a303f2ab15fd1147429ad7e46b3748fdf0925cafa4b9272508a2","ja":"はっ、もしかして……。","zh":"啊，难道说……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ee6c2b42bc6ac184a67bfbe68cd0aa9f0eaccb53c46de6d336e67bce11440c58","ja":"そう。実は、今までのぜーんぶ、逆ドッキリなの。","zh":"没错。其实，刚才那些全～部都是反整蛊哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"17ae31d235da3824f5e67ab167fc7d586084a5ec786128077b89ca8465cae56e","ja":"いきなりドッキリの仕掛人にさせられた\nみんなの様子を、スタジオで観察してたのよ。","zh":"突然被安排当整蛊整人者的大家\n是什么样子，我一直在演播室里观察哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"154d0755013d1fbdaaf896e360f965fd96e1476d240de10bda2828153dadbc2d","ja":"そうだったんだ！　このみさんの演技がよかったから、\n桃子全然気づかなかったよ……。","zh":"原来是这样啊！因为木实姐的演技太好了，\n桃子完全没有注意到呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"462d419bdb0e99f47e56fa55f28df518f77cbd184ad962c3379bee2477cc10a6","ja":"わたしも……。このみさん、すごいね。","zh":"我也是……。木实姐好厉害啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"dfa707f1c1859afa61380b48f2530a94b45c3647c774594cde02dd121e31b0ed","ja":"ありがと。\nでもみんなもなかなかだったわよ。","zh":"谢谢。\n不过大家也都很棒哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"ee24dc098b33cec3073942bf2e159dc1e09cbc0b3664cfa45b84bb41edfea4eb","ja":"特に廊下で不気味な声が聞こえてきた時なんて、\n逆ドッキリって分かってるのに怖くなっちゃったわ。","zh":"特别是在走廊里听到诡异的声音时，\n明明知道是在反整蛊，却还是觉得害怕呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"52b3bf12702a6f927dab570f916862588f20cff053b8863d450c4318147aa26a","ja":"えっ？　わたしたち、そんなことしてないよ？","zh":"诶？我们可没做过那种事哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"836133fd7d5bdfeda075db19698e995b5cc3a67d62f1b52aef51a0924839471a","ja":"うん。台本にも、「隠しカメラがある楽屋で\nドッキリをするように」って、書いてあったし。","zh":"嗯。台词本上也写着，“要在装有隐藏摄像机的\n休息室里整蛊”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1316.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8281095ce7b2870a55ea0b37166d41c0850a96fb5c32517b37a2be71393c067e","ja":"えっ……そ、それじゃあ、あの時の声って……\nもしかして、本物……！？","zh":"咦……那、这么说来，那时候的声音……\n难道是，真的……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
